# Project Conventions

## Structure

- `src/app/`: Next.js App Router
- `src/components/`: common, layout, ui
- `src/styles/`: tokens, GlobalStyles, EmotionRegistry
- `src/lib/notion/`: Notion API

## Path Alias

- `@/*` → `./src/*`

## Component Pattern

- `[Name].tsx` + `[Name].styled.ts` + `index.ts`
- styled 파일 상단에 `"use client"` (Emotion)

## Formatting

- Prettier: semi, double quote, 2 spaces, trailingComma es5, printWidth 80
